35.3.7 Gnomish racial ascension - gnome selected as the race, did
  not weild a non-gnomish weapon (only aklys allowed (Yes, I know,
  it does not say "Gnomish", but who appears with them other than
  gnomes, and I've got to throw  them a bone here, they are going to
  be naked for RNG's sake!)), did not wear non-gnomish armor (yes,
  there is no gnome armor).
  Patience: Slight  Luck: Slight  Planning: Trivial

Gnomie Notes

Gnomes: They get no armor, and about the best you can do for
a weapon would be to argue for the alkys. To me, that makes
it sound like combat-wombat is right out. So, what class to
pick? I'm taking Archeologist. Why? The Quest artifact supplies
Magic Resistance, and it does not require weilding or wearing
to do that. Second, Archs can be fair spell-casters. Given that
I won't have any of that pesky armor reducing spell success
rates, I might as well concentrate on the casting.

I fully intend on running the protection racket and leaning
quite a bit on pets in this game. Wishing for the Eye to allow
more spell casting will be a temptation. Lets see if I get
far enough to actually have a chance at it.


