Attempt #20:
T4 I have removed the starting jacket and fedora. I wish that
there was some armor which was clearly Gnomish, but I guess
this will be a naked ascension if I can make it happen.
T10700 (I stopped taking early notes because I was losing so
many Gnomies) I did the protection racket, completed Sokoban
for the bag, have found a magic lamp, marker, and luckstone.
T13231 I tried exploring the Mines for a poly trap to process
some of the half-dozen pets I had into something stronger. I
didn't find any and I lost all the pets. Time for a new
tactic: I had a clear potion, a converted altar and a
magic lamp. I use all of those to get a pet Archon who came
with Demonbane.
T18158 A throne on Dlvl 15 granted a wish so I went for an
amulet of reflection.
T18543 Dlvl 16 also had a throne that granted a wish. I have
lost enough Gnomes that I'm not going to hold back: The Eye
of the Aethiopica!
T26033 I cleaned out the Fort and processed all of the gold
through the Minetown priest and one other I found on Dlvl 10.
I am now AC-3 naked. I managed to get a spellbook of
create monster and so I'm trying to work my protection up
at an altar on Dlvl 11. I have been crowned (so the Vorpal
Blade is ducked out of the way) and just got Magicbane
while offering to reduce prayer timeout. Oh well. I do
like MB for the single turn engrave.

Well, I prayed when I shouldn't have and blew the -2 naked
AC that I had built up through donations. Bummer. Exploring
down looking for more priests I found Medusa at Dlvl 23,
there was a hole near the up stairs so I decided to peek
at the level below. It dropped me two levels to the Castle.
So, my Archon and I cleared it. Fun to do with me at experience
level 11 and AC 10 (or 8 if I put on both rings of
protection that I have found).
T29835 I've got the Castle wand.
T33559 I trucked my 90k gold down to the Valley priest and
got naked AC 0 again. Back at my stash and I got my
first successful protection prayer. I think I would like
an AC of around -20, but I'll see how it goes.
T35457 My work has produced a scroll of genocide, so
goodbye c's.
T37802 I got to Elvl 14 and so did the quest, mainly to
see what supplies I could get. I had not recalled what a
banquet of food the A quest offers. My Archon with
Demonbane made short work of the Minion.
T39276 One more divine protection for AC -2.
T46102 Finally, another point of protection for AC -3.
I may give up on -20, but would still like -5 or so.
T47062 I'm bored. Let's see if impatience will be the
death of another Gnomie...
T47077 Castle WoW wish #1: 2 blessed scrolls of charging.
T47081 I wrote some scrolls of genocide: Goodbye L's.
T47082 Goodbye t's.
T47084 Goodbye w's.
T47322 Entering Gehennom...
T47331 And I meet a Green Slime first thing so,
Goodbye P's.
T50611 I explored down to the vibrating square and came
back to my Dlvl 11 stash to prepare for an ascension run.
Thus far only having AC-3 and no magic cancellation has
not been as difficult as I thought it would be. My 211 HP
and dual +6 aklyses even make me (almost) an even match
in melee with minotaurs.
T52165 (Poly-party, alchemy, sorting) I used my second
Castle wand wish for (of all things) candles. I only
found four in the dungeon.
T52720 I started the ascension run and found Grayswandir
on the floor in the Wizard's Tower. My Archon is now
weilding it. Whee!


