I expected the gnome to be the hardest (what with the nakedness and
all). And yes, I lost many characters who never got below dungeon level
8 or so. (But a surprising number made it to the Minetown temple and
got
armor class dropped to 2 or 3 before doing something stupid or getting
separated from their pet.)

So, in answer to Robin Johnson's challenge of 21 Dec 2004 for ascending
a naked gnome with an aklys, here is one with not one, but _two_ +6
aklyses! And interestingly (to me) this gnome got to be a pretty good
fighter with just those. A few of the times that I got rid of Rodney
it was done by just closing in and bashing away.


